      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "17下",
      "column_from_right": 2,
      "physical_start": 0,
      "physical_end": 18,
      "reading": "明三年為齊世子妃建元元年為皇太子妃二",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=20"
    },
    {
      "group": "P2",
      "column": "20R03",
      "pdf_page": 20,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "17下",
      "column_from_right": 3,
      "physical_start": 0,
      "physical_end": 18,
      "reading": "年后薨諡穆妃葬休安陵時議欲立石誌王儉",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=20"
    },
    {
