      "column": "20R04",
      "pdf_page": 20,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "17下",
      "column_from_right": 4,
      "physical_start": 0,
      "physical_end": 18,
      "reading": "曰石誌不出禮起宋元嘉中顏延之為王球石",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=20"
    },
    {
      "group": "P2",
      "column": "20R05",
      "pdf_page": 20,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "17下",
      "column_from_right": 5,
      "physical_start": 0,
      "physical_end": 18,
      "reading": "誌素族無銘策故以紀行自爾以來共相祖習",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=20"
    },
    {
      "group": "P2",
      "column": "20R06",
      "pdf_page": 20,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "17下",
      "column_from_right": 6,
      "physical_start": 0,
      "physical_end": 18,
      "reading": "儲妃之重禮絕恒例既有哀策不煩石誌從之",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=20"
    },
    {
